Axiom Tietze_extension_open_interval : forall X Tx A f : set , normal_space X Tx -> closed_in X Tx A -> continuous_map A (subspace_topology X Tx A) (open_interval (minus_SNo 1) 1) (subspace_topology R R_standard_topology (open_interval (minus_SNo 1) 1)) f -> exists g : set , continuous_map X Tx (open_interval (minus_SNo 1) 1) (subspace_topology R R_standard_topology (open_interval (minus_SNo 1) 1)) g /\ (forall x : set , x :e A -> apply_fun g x = apply_fun f x).
