(** from S55 Exercise 4(d) (line 1049 in algtop.tex) **)
(** LATEX VERSION: Given no retraction B^{n+1} -> S^n, every continuous map f: B^{n+1} -> B^{n+1} has a fixed point. **)
(** EFFORT: 4 lines textbook, difficulty 3/10, USD 50 **)
