(** from S60 Exercise 2 (line 1779 in algtop.tex) **)
(** LATEX VERSION: B^2 with antipodal identification on S^1 is homeomorphic to P^2. **)
(** EFFORT: 10 lines textbook, difficulty 5/10, USD 100 **)
