(** from S66 Exercise 1 (line 2572 in algtop.tex) **)
(** LATEX VERSION: n(f,a) equals the degree of the induced map h: S^1 -> S^1. **)
(** EFFORT: 4 lines textbook, difficulty 3/10, USD 50 **)
