	                     (U :/\: V) (subspace_topology X Tx (U :/\: V)) x0
	                     V (subspace_topology X Tx V) x0
	                     (graph (U :/\: V) (fun x:set => x))) g)))).
exact classical_van_kampen_free_product_kernel_helper.
