	    free_group_with_generators
	      (fundamental_group X Tx p)
	      (fundamental_group_mult X Tx p)
	      (fundamental_group_id X Tx p)
	      (fundamental_group_inv X Tx p)
	      n gens.
exact pi1_finite_wedge_of_circles_free_helper.
